<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4493] ODBC: Add missing diagnostic records in case of API errors</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4493</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The following functions in Ignite ODBC driver do not strictly follow the API documentation with regard to diagnostics. It should be possible to obtain additional information about errors via SQLGetDiagRec() call.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;SQLAllocHandle&lt;br/&gt;
SQLFreeHandle&lt;br/&gt;
SQLFreeStmt&lt;br/&gt;
SQLBindCol&lt;br/&gt;
SQLFetchScroll&lt;br/&gt;
SQLBindParameter&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
